  "html": "<h2>The Goal Becomes an Activity</h2>\n<div class=\"pic pic-activity\" data-steps=\"8\" data-intro=\"Press play: each line of the goal becomes an act.\" data-captions='[\"Open: ARTIE enters at the forge gateway and gets pull request 501 by scm:pulls-get.\",\"Ask: the watcher takes the request and makes a reply; ARTIE rests until it is answered.\",\"Merge: once answered, ARTIE acts scm:merge on 501, method squash.\",\"Build: the CI wrapper has Jenkins build the merged commit; ARTIE rests again.\",\"Follow: the answered reply links the build, hr:in-reply-to.\",\"Smoke: ARTIE runs the script the build links, on the preview it deployed.\",\"Decide: passed, so ARTIE promotes the commit at Dev, citing 5 of 5. Done.\",\"Otherwise: had the smoke failed (as 504&#39;s did), a comment on the pull request instead.\"]'>\n  <div class=\"pic-two\">\n  <ol class=\"pic-goal\">\n    <li class=\"keep\" data-at=\"1\">Open pull request {pull} of {owner}/{repo}</li>\n    <li class=\"keep\" data-at=\"2\">At {watcher}, ask to be told when {pr} offers scm:merge</li>\n    <li class=\"keep\" data-at=\"3\">Once {watch} is answered, at {pr}, merge it by squashing</li>\n    <li class=\"keep\" data-at=\"4\">At {jenkins}, build commit {merged.merge_commit_sha}, asking to be told how it goes</li>\n    <li class=\"keep\" data-at=\"5\">Once {build} is answered, follow its in-reply-to link to the build</li>\n    <li class=\"keep\" data-at=\"6\">Run the smoke script it links as ci:smoke-test, on the deployment it links as ci:deployment</li>\n    <li class=\"keep\" data-at=\"7\">If {smoke.passed}, at {dev}, open environment {environment} and promote commit…</li>\n    <li class=\"keep\" data-at=\"8\">Otherwise, at {pr}, act scm:comment with body = &quot;Not promoted to Dev…&quot;</li>\n  </ol>\n  <svg class=\"pic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 682 600\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The goal as a swimlane activity\"><defs><marker id=\"pic-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" 